    <question_explanation no="19" id="PRB-F67F8DF47412A85E-Q19">
      <question_stem>㉠ ∼ ㉣ 중 ‘à’가 들어갈 수 없는 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="&lt;보기&gt; 조합형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="복합 보기 검증형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>㉣</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · 전치사 à
정답은 ④이다. se décider à + 동사원형, choses à voir(볼 것), à Genève(도시 앞 à)에는 à가 들어간다. ㉣은 vieux quartiers 앞이므로 부분관사 de(형용사 + 복수 명사 앞)가 들어가야 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>㉠</choice_text>
          <commentary>à가 들어간다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>㉡</choice_text>
          <commentary>à가 들어간다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>㉢</choice_text>
          <commentary>à가 들어간다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>㉣</choice_text>
          <commentary>de가 들어가므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="20" id="PRB-F67F8DF47412A85E-Q20">
      <question_stem>우리말을 불어로 잘못 옮긴 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>우리말</keyword>
        <keyword>불어</keyword>
        <keyword>잘못</keyword>
        <keyword>옮긴</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Qui a-t-il changé !</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 불어 · 감탄문
정답은 ②이다. 감탄문은 Que, Comme, Combien, Qu'est-ce que 등으로 만든다. Qui a-t-il changé는 '그가 누구를 바꿨는가'라는 의문문으로 감탄의 의미가 되지 않는다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Qu'il a changé !</choice_text>
          <commentary>Qu'il a changé는 옳은 감탄문이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Qui a-t-il changé !</choice_text>
          <commentary>의문문이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Combien il a changé !</choice_text>
          <commentary>Combien il a changé는 옳은 감탄문이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>Qu'est-qu'il a changé !</choice_text>
          <commentary>공식 정답에 따르면 옳은 감탄 표현으로 본다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
